ge-sports/story/_/id/50595702/judge-denies-sec-request-tro-lsu-dec-3-vote","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 13 Game Day Kickoff: Nothing compares to the outright hatred of a rival","description":"What to expect in Rivalry Week, from top games and players to teams on upset alert.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedaykickoff112526/week-13-top-games-upsets-preview","type":"Story","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Oklahoma State extends Morris with new 6-year deal","description":"Oklahoma State and head coach Eric Morris have agreed to a new six-year deal that will extend his contract through the 2032 season, sources told ESPN's Pete Thamel on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T17:00:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50594432/sources-oklahoma-state-extends-morris-new-six-year-deal","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where the program will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-25T15:16:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: USC favored at UCLA, Texas double-digit faves at Texas A&M","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for UCLA-USC, Texas A&M-Texas and more.","published":"2026-11-25T15:00:51.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50571004/2026-college-football-week-13-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Manuel to remain Michigan AD until new hire is found","description":"Warde Manuel has agreed to stay in the job as Michigan's athletic director until the school finds a new athletic director, sources told ESPN on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T16:12:47.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50592920/sources-manuel-stay-job-new-michigan-ad-hired","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5067875/zach-lutmer","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Lutmer"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Zach Lutmer","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Lutmer","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:24Z","intro":"Zach Lutmer (born November 5, 2004) is an American college football defensive back for the Iowa Hawkeyes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Lutmer attended Central Lyon High School in Rock Rapids, Iowa, where he played defensive back and quarterback. During his career he set school records for total yards, rushing yards and points scored. As a sophomore, Lutmer was the Class 2A Player of the Year after recording 1,194 passing yards, eight passing touchdowns, 1,609 rushing yards with 23 rushing touchdowns on offense and four interceptions, with two returned for a touchdown on defense. As a junior, he had 1,016 passing yards with eight touchdowns, 1,246 rushing yards with 22 touchdowns, and four interceptions with one returned for a touchdown. During his senior year he had 1,357 passing yards with 16 touchdowns, 1,562 rushing yards with 22 touchdowns and three interceptions. Lutmer committed to the University of Iowa to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Lutmer played in two games and redshirted his first year at Iowa in 2023. As a redshirt freshman in 2024, he played in all 13 games and had 14 tackles and one interception. Lutmer entered his redshirt sophomore year in 2025 as a starter."}]}}